# Riot's instances work separately (CR 702.136b). A second Spider-Punk has its own printed riot and, as it would enter, the
# riot the first one gives other Spiders, so Bot1 chooses twice: the +1/+1 counter both times, a 4/3. The legend rule then
# keeps one; Bot1 keeps the new one.

